{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14104350","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14104350","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1410435001:1":{"text":"여왕님의 영광은 영원하리! 근위대장님께 보고드립니다! 이 낙인이 찍힌 평민이 대열에 무모하게 끼어들려고 하는 것을 제가 붙잡았습니다!","source_cn":"女王荣光永存！报告卫队长！这名带印记的平民妄图混入队伍...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD74C86F1868F943","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1410435002:1":{"text":"저를 위한 게 아니라, 베스비를 위한 거예요. 베스비는 지금 너무 허약한 상태에요. 어쩌면 곧...","source_cn":"我不是为了自己，是贝丝薇。贝丝薇太虚弱了。她快要……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x037B6D3F7EBE6744","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1410435003:1":{"text":"제발 부탁드려요, 경비병 여러분! 베스비에게 자비를 베풀어 주세요!","source_cn":"求求你们了，各位卫兵大人们！给贝丝薇一点怜悯吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x61771932570AE04D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1410435004:1":{"text":"직접 가져가라고 해. 대리 수령은 위법인 거 몰라?!","source_cn":"让她自己来取，律法有言，不得代领！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7A0B81741CE86B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1410435005:1":{"text":"베스비... 도 낙인이 있어서...","source_cn":"贝丝薇……也身负印记，她——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1A7FD1001E02691","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1410435006:1":{"text":"참나! 그럼 더 얘기할 것도 없지! 제사장님께서 아무 이유도 없이, 죄 없는 자를 벌하셨을까 봐?","source_cn":"哼！那还有什么好说的！祭司大人们难道会平白无故地惩罚无...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x533BD077FC0B2E33","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1410435007:1":{"text":"부디 자비를 베풀어 주세요, 경비병님!","source_cn":"给她一点慈悲吧，卫兵大人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E2F04F3999034BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1410435008:1":{"text":"빅샤, 고마워요. 하지만 어쩔 수 없는 것 같네요...","source_cn":"维克莎，多谢你。我已经知道该怎么做了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2AF0F4E8E72F0E6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1410435009:1":{"text":"그래, 평민. 일찌감치 단념하는 게 좋아.","source_cn":"没错，平民。早点死心为好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A6B85A74E0C7EF5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1410435010:1":{"text":"참, 이따가 그 평민의 위치도 알려주고! 우리가 알아서 잘 처리해 줄 테니까.","source_cn":"对了，待会记得上报她的位置，我们会负责清理。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4EF2690421B342FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1410435011:1":{"text":"아뇨, 베스비는 괜찮아요. 아직 버틸 수 있어요... 먼저 가볼게요! 베스비한테 제가 필요하거든요!","source_cn":"不，贝丝薇还好。她还能坚持……我先走了！她现在很需要我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57829F2BFA423FDB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1410435012:1":{"text":"당신들... 정말 너무하네요!","source_cn":"你们……太欺负人了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE3849AC2284E00E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1410435013:1":{"text":"이봐, 교대할 시간이니 준비하도록.","source_cn":"你，时候不早了，准备交接吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA2B6D02C9B44BB32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1410435014:1":{"text":"근위대장님, 저 녀석을 감시하지 않아도 되겠습니까? 만약을 대비해서라도...","source_cn":"卫队长，我们真的不用去盯着那小子吗？以防万一……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D97CE37AEF3809F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1410435015:1":{"text":"...괜찮다. 내가 알아서 할 테니 넌 가서 쉬도록 해라.","source_cn":"……无事，我稍后再安排。你早点回去休息。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x71133FCED0E37672","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1410435016:1":{"text":"알겠습니다! 여왕님의 영광은 영원하리!","source_cn":"遵命！女王荣光永存！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0F14F9E84621734","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1410435017:1":{"text":"줄을 똑바로 서서 한 명씩 받아 가도록!","source_cn":"都排好队，一个一个来领取！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x631B897D98B30B62","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1410435018:1":{"text":"어?! 저거 인듀어아이가?! 다들 줄 똑디 서라!","source_cn":"是因度厄！大家该排队的好好排队……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D1F94BFC42CBB3E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1410435019:1":{"text":"인듀어 근위대장이 오셨다!","source_cn":"因度厄卫队长来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC3433592303C7E23","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:凶狠的卫兵":{"text":"사나운 경비병","source":"凶狠的卫兵","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:凯登":{"text":"케이든","source":"凯登","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:平民维克莎":{"text":"평민 빅샤","source":"平民维克莎","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:因度厄":{"text":"인듀어","source":"因度厄","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:反叛的平民":{"text":"반란을 꾀하는 평민","source":"反叛的平民","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:应声的平民":{"text":"옹호하는 평민","source":"应声的平民","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":20,"localized_text_count":19,"speaker_count":6}}